{"4282120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Infernal Descent", "steam_appid": 4282120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plunge headfirst into the depths of <strong>Hell</strong> in a brutal, fast-paced action game inspired by <i>Dante’s Inferno</i>. Each level drags you deeper through the <strong>Nine Circles</strong>, where sin shapes the world, enemies grow more grotesque, and survival demands absolute mastery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE NINE CIRCLES AWAIT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the despairing fields of <strong>Limbo</strong> to the frozen abyss of <strong>Treachery</strong>, every circle is a self-contained gauntlet with its own mechanics, hazards, enemies, and bosses inspired by the sins that rule them.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lust</strong> tempts and disorients</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gluttony</strong> overwhelms and consumes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wrath</strong> erupts in chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pride</strong> punishes arrogance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Treachery</strong> leaves no room for mercy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each descent tests reflexes, positioning, and decision-making at relentless speed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FACE THE LORD OF HELL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive all nine circles and confront <strong>Satan himself</strong>, the final embodiment of sin and damnation. Victory is not guaranteed — Hell does not want you to leave.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ Auto-Attack Combat (Bullet Heaven)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 Nine unique hellish biomes based on Dante’s Inferno</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👹 Sin-themed enemies and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⛓️ Relentless difficulty that rewards mastery</p><